{"version":1,"key":"card:634","content":{"id":634,"content":[{"children":[{"text":"在 HTTP/1.1 中，强制要求请求和响应必须是“先进先出”（FIFO）的顺序，因为 ","type":"formatted"},{"bold":true,"color":"#245bdb","darkColor":"#70a0ff","text":"HTTP/1.1 协议本身没有在消息中加入任何用于配对请求和响应的标识符","type":"formatted"},{"text":"，为了将请求和响应一一对应，因此必须按序处理响应。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"cec3baf7-f749-43de-9885-765261af6196","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"这就意味着如果前一个请求响应尚未完成，后续的请求必须排队等待，即使后续请求的响应已经准备好了也不能被发送，如果前一个请求的响应迟迟得不到答复（比如数据库等耗时操作），就会阻塞后续响应，这就是队头阻塞。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"1962fe65-0a42-4828-a506-f0e0cc6522a5","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"客户端发送:\n[Request A][Request B][Request C]\n\n服务器响应流:\n[Response A Headers][Response A Body][Response B Headers][Response B Body][Response C Headers][Response C Body]\n^                                  ^\n|                                  |\n客户端必须知道这里是A的结尾         才能开始解析B","collabId":"8b27755f-a3d7-4ec8-85c7-7d1384938e99","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"c8df4d20-eb0e-4895-9a51-4ab780f58ab0","language":"HTTP","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"de8c1c94-1e55-40d1-b6fb-2ac8475fcc95"},{"calloutType":"info","children":[{"children":[{"text":"在 HTTP/1.1 中为了区分响应的边界，使用 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"Content-Length","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 或 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"Transfer-Ecoding: chunked","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 响应头来识别响应的边界。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"3955be7d-8261-42da-b88d-0f246f051fd9","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"77aba640-523a-4396-80dc-9de18a30bd4b","tauContract":"82a3e58fc7df817d12ed2ff5fb675ef0d468689701d99d9471018c2dbd8a3221","title":"","type":"callout"},{"children":[{"text":"HTTP/2 通过引入带有 Stream ID 的二进制帧（Frame） 解决了这个问题，每个帧都知道自己属于哪个请求，因此可以乱序传输，客户端可以根据 Stream ID 将这些帧组装起来。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"f1be0477-89e0-4795-a966-9403e8dffb3c","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"虽然 HTTP/2 解决了 HTTP 应用层的队头阻塞，但是没有解决 TCP 层面的队头阻塞。因为 TCP 是一个可靠的传输层协议（有序性与完整性），如果在传输过程中丢了一个包，即使后续的包已经到达，也无需交付给客户端，必须等到这个包重传成功才行，这个等待重传的过程就是 TCP 层面的队头阻塞。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"14c4793a-dd79-4925-a4aa-27f7f075e2e7","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"在 HTTP/3 使用了基于 UDP 的 QUIC 协议，它在 UDP 之上实现了类似 TCP 的可靠传输、流量控制等功能，流之间完全独立。如果一个承载着流 A 数据的 UDP 包丢失了，它只会影响到流 A。流 B 和流 C 的数据包如果正常到达，就可以被立刻处理，完全不受流 A 的影响。彻底的解决了队头阻塞的问题。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"271b83ef-a4aa-48c5-8da6-1c0955412316","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"tags":["HTTP"],"createTime":1760058892238,"updateTime":1793532567960,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1793532567960}}